      | order_system | 2026-11-22T10:00:00.000Z | reserve-0001    | <order_id> | <reserve_lines> | <ttl_minutes> | [{"sku": "WIDGET-1", "location": "AMS-B-0142", "on_hand": 500, "reserved": 100, "available": 400}, {"sku": "GADGET-2", "location": "AMS-B-0143", "on_hand": 50, "reserved": 40, "available": 10}] | <open_reservation> |
